@step Preview the census facts AEAT holds for you.
@static aeat config profile censo pull
@blocked live-aeat The pull reads the AEAT sede consulta over an authenticated session; the sandbox refuses live frames.
@step Record the previewed facts onto the active profile.
@static aeat config profile censo pull --apply
@blocked live-aeat The pull reads the AEAT sede consulta over an authenticated session; the sandbox refuses live frames.
